---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — TooManyToolz">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose prose-sm">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

    <h2>What This Site Does</h2>
    <p>TooManyToolz provides free online utility tools (formatters, converters, generators, and calculators). All tool processing happens directly in your browser — text and data you enter into our tools is not sent to or stored on our servers.</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use this site, which may collect standard information such as your approximate location, browser type, device type, and pages visited. This data is aggregated and does not identify you personally.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and Advertising</h2>
    <p>This site may display advertisements served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's Ads Settings.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>This site may contain links to third-party services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those external sites.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600">Contact page</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>